---
args: {"candidate": "PackageCandidate", "offers": "QuoteOption[]", "replies": "TermReply[]", "mandate": "MandateBoundary"}
returns: "PackageCandidate"
---
For each allocation compare the actual offer condition with all other allocations and qualified responses. Test exclusivity at the specified product/region/time scope, bundle prerequisites and early commitments. Check quantity conservation in original units and exact prices only under an evidenced authorized conversion; use integer minor units and rational quantities in eval, never binary floating-point currency. Mark unavailable exact numeric inputs as blockers. Preserve material service, lead-time and resilience tradeoffs as distinct explanations. Return the candidate with the specific violated condition and source for every rejection.
